WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:09.040 align:start position:19%
And then, at dawn,
the mountain sends its final word.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:15.840 align:start position:19%
A pyroclastic surge, a wall of gas and
ash heated to 300°

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:20.360 align:start position:19%
races down the slope at 700 km/h.
Nothing outruns it.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:24.880 align:start position:19%
In less than 4 minutes, every living
thing in Pompeii is gone.

